-- CONTROL CHARACTER ------------------------------------------ main.kl  SEC0102

I found the control character U+0007  here. Control characters are invisible, and terminals and editors each handle them differently.

2│     let name = "Sara"
                     ^

Try: `\u{7}`

Help: Inside a string, write it as an escape such as `\u{...}`. Anywhere else, delete it.

